{"name":"Burning Idea","hex":"#8f8b72","fetched":"2026-10-16","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"burning","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["present participle and gerund of burn"]},{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["So hot as to seem to burn (something).","Feeling very hot."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/burning"},{"term":"idea","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["An abstract archetype of a given thing, compared to which real-life examples are seen as imperfect approximations; pure essence, as opposed to actual examples. .mw-parser-output .defdate{font-size:smaller}","The conception of someone or something as representing a perfect example; an ideal."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/idea"}],"entries":[{"title":"Idea","blocks":[{"text":"An idea is the result of thought. Although the word is used in common usage, in philosophy, ideas can also be mental representational images of some object. Many philosophers have considered ideas to be a fundamental ontological category of being. The capacity to create and understand the meaning of ideas is considered to be an essential and defining feature of human beings."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4a/Plato-raphael.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Idea"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4a/Plato-raphael.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled 1x","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/4a/Plato-raphael.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","alt":"Plato, one of the first philosophers to discuss ideas in detail. Aristotle claims that many of Plato's views were Pythagorean in origin.","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APlato-raphael.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/55/Printing4_Walk_of_Ideas_Berlin.JPG/330px-Printing4_Walk_of_Ideas_Berlin.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/55/Printing4_Walk_of_Ideas_Berlin.JPG/330px-Printing4_Walk_of_Ideas_Berlin.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"\"Modern Book Printing\" from the Walk of Ideas","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APrinting4_Walk_of_Ideas_Berlin.JPG"}],"sounds":{"burning":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/4/41/En-us-burning.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/41/En-us-burning.ogg/En-us-burning.ogg.mp3"}],"idea":[{"type":"audio/ogg; codecs=\"vorbis\"","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/90/En-us-idea.ogg?utm_source=en.wiktionary.org&utm_campaign=rest&utm_content=original"},{"type":"audio/mpeg","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/90/En-us-idea.ogg/En-us-idea.ogg.mp3"}]},"pictures":[{"title":"Eastern grey kangaroo (Macropus giganteus) Mount Annan composite of 6","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/46/Eastern_grey_kangaroo_%28Macropus_giganteus%29_Mount_Annan_composite_of_6.jpg/500px-Eastern_grey_kangaroo_%28Macropus_giganteus%29_Mount_Annan_composite_of_6.jpg","ratio":4.413151003782368,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Eastern_grey_kangaroo_(Macropus_giganteus)_Mount_Annan_composite_of_6.jpg","share":0.40625},{"title":"Episode after Battle of Zonnebeke 1918 Hurley restoration","image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/b1/Episode_after_Battle_of_Zonnebeke_1918_Hurley_restoration.jpg/500px-Episode_after_Battle_of_Zonnebeke_1918_Hurley_restoration.jpg","ratio":1.4752654752654752,"link":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Episode_afte